{"id": "64940", "title": "儿子们，太闷骚", "author": "冷优然", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 36, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/64/64940.htm", "intro": "A市有个齐家，是个怪异却温馨的家庭，一家四口人，一个妈咪和三个儿子。这怪，就怪在，这个妈咪貌美如花，年过三十，却依旧是娇嫩如二十一。而这三个儿子，一个二十五，一个二十三，一个十八，个个长得英俊潇洒、风流倜傥，却是单身男三枚…", "base": "files/article/html/64/64940", "chapters": [{"title": "1-7", "file": "9665651.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8-14", "file": "9665656.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15-21", "file": "9665659.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-29", "file": "9665661.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30-37", "file": "9665662.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-45", "file": "9665663.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-48", "file": "9665666.html", "available": false}, {"title": "49-52", "file": "9665668.html", "available": false}, {"title": "53-56", "file": "9665670.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-59", "file": "9665673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "60-63", "file": "9665674.html", "available": false}, {"title": "64-66", "file": "9665675.html", "available": false}, {"title": "67-70", "file": "9665676.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-74", "file": "9665679.html", "available": false}, {"title": "75-79", "file": "9665681.html", "available": false}, {"title": "80-82", "file": "9665682.html", "available": false}, {"title": "83-86", "file": "9665683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "87-89", "file": "9665684.html", "available": false}, {"title": "90-93", "file": "9665686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "94-95", "file": "9665687.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-99", "file": "9665688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "100-106", "file": "9665689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "107-110", "file": "9665691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "111-114", "file": "9665693.html", "available": false}, {"title": "115-119", "file": "9665697.html", "available": false}, {"title": "120-124", "file": "9665698.htm